  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "智慧生活科技",
    "sub_ename": "SMART LIVING TECHNOLOGY",
    "describe_ch": "人們在生活中享受各種工程與科技的成果而不自知，本課程將把學期分成兩大部分如同課程名稱所述，一部分將帶領同學探索及認識國際上極具研究價值之科技工程產品如亞馬遜之無人商店Amazon Go或3D列印科技等技術進行深度剖析和拆解，將此些科技產品之歷史背景、發想來源以及結構設計和技術應用一一詳解，並接續使用其概念以團體討論方式發想其未來發展技術應用為何。於下半學期將帶領同學進入人工智慧以及機器學習領域，除了帶領同學完整認識何謂人工智慧的概念和現今於社會上之應用外，更將帶領同學進行創新人工智慧概念設計結合機器學習創造極具研究價值之創新人工智慧概念。",
    "describe_eh": "People enjoy various achievements of engineering and technology in our daily life without knowing it. This course will divide the semester into two parts, as the name of the course says. One part will lead students to explore and understand scientific and technological projects with great research value in the world products such as Amazon's unmanned store Amazon Go or 3D printing technology which has been deeply analyzed and disassembled. Also the inspirations, structural design, and technical applications of these technological products are explained in detail, and the concepts are used in group discussions of thinking about its future development technology application. In the second half of the semester, students will be led into the field of artificial intelligence and machine learning. In addition to leading students to fully understand the concept of artificial intelligence and its current application in society, it will also lead students to actually start innovative artificial intelligence conceptual design combined with machine learning to design innovative artificial intelligence software with great research value.",
